carried library: 270 kept company-figure statements in 61 repeat groups, and 46 to 61 groups not shown to each of the 12 judged
questions. Two families read every question with its whole last request; no pair would move an answer, and the controls behaved
(Claude's family) or failed on my own packet fault (Codex's). Its stated limits:

- a fixed measure list;
- repeat groups dropped when any member was shown;
- summaries, not source passages;
- predictions, not sends.

